oneOf.description:
Regular 2D rows/columns with independently directed axes. Distances dx/dy are metres;
angles are degrees counter-clockwise from world east, independent of the item rotation.
Order and item identity are row-major, exactly as Grid. Parallel axes are refused.

notes.description:
A text field's key each step writes its notes on the record's fields to (docs/adr/0442 §4): the
latest step's notes as canonical JSON (`{"<field key>":"<note>"}`), emptied by a step without;
read-only in the form, shown under the fields.

clip.description:
The part shown, in the picture's own fractions (0,0 its lower left,
1,1 its upper right): at least three corners inside the unit square;
absent: the whole picture.

compose.description:
How it is composed into the drawing (Katman çizimi, docs/adr/0226 §3,
§4): opacity, blending mode, the mask it cuts into other layers;
absent, opaque and normal. Only a layer has it, never a group.

plot.description:
Yazdır: absent, it is printed; `false`, it is drawn on screen but not
on a sheet, its PDF or a print (AutoCAD's plot switch, DXF's 290;
docs/adr/0260 §4). A group's covers what it holds. Only `false` is written.

code.description:
Its joinery code (docs/adr/8028; doğrama kodu, as Mimarlar Odası's and İTÜ's notes write it: K01 a door, GK01 a
door in the building's outer wall, P01 a window, B01 a bare opening): the same on every opening of the type;
unique in the project, case aside; at most 16 letters, digits, `-` or `.`. Absent: none (KCAD schema 220).

ms.description:
A polyline's vertices' measures (M) on a route, as many as `pts`;
`null` for a vertex without one; absent when none has one
(docs/adr/0224 §1). A polygon has none: a route is a line.

parcelRegister.description:
The parcel register (plan/map-cad.md MAP-08, docs/adr/4220): the documents that made and closed parcels, each
parcel as its document made it and the boundaries the parcels share, apart from the areas that draw them;
absent: none (`.kcad` schema 216).

reduceToGrid.description:
Kutupsal alım and Poligon hesabı take measured (ground) lengths to the
grid, Aplikasyon gives grid lengths on the ground (docs/adr/0171 §4;
schema 16): only with a ground height; absent, off.
